{"overview":"گورو تبه‌کاری است که با شنیدن خبر دزدیده شدن هرم بزرگ جیزه تصمیم می‌گیرد تا برای تحت تأثیر قرار دادن رئیس بانکی که از آن برای کارهایش وام می‌گیرد، ماه را بدزدد…","tagline":"","overview_en":"Determined to prove he's the world's greatest supervillain, Gru hatches an audacious plan to steal the Moon. To pull it off, he adopts three orphaned girls—Margo, Edith, and Agnes—intending to use them as pawns in his scheme. But the unexpected bond they form forces him to question the criminal life he's always known.","tagline_en":"Superbad. Superdad.","runtime":95,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Pierre Coffin","Chris Renaud"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"استیو کارل","role":"Gru (voice)","photo":"/sSxw69G0znJuettMYGDCAXfSwSY.jpg","en":"Steve Carell"},{"name":"جیسون سیگل","role":"Vector (voice)","photo":"/aG6tVNSbl1YEjN65G3luFYnWbUM.jpg","en":"Jason Segel"},{"name":"Russell Brand","role":"Dr. Nefario (voice)","photo":"/AzRt43rdeK5nH7w6uWyyVwYla0.jpg"},{"name":"Julie Andrews","role":"Gru's Mother (voice)","photo":"/yQ0J92DMiLtQYoytLJ6CuBkdeN0.jpg"},{"name":"ویل آرنت","role":"Mr. Perkins (voice)","photo":"/cXupYqk2ERP13XBkw816skYdVDO.jpg","en":"Will Arnett"},{"name":"کریستن ویگ","role":"Miss Hattie (voice)","photo":"/6U6UGztBwk7c4lg8n5BS5QOByot.jpg","en":"Kristen Wiig"},{"name":"ماریاندا کازگرو","role":"Margo (voice)","photo":"/qIGeoyXEVu1LxTH34TWx1YSHyQr.jpg","en":"Miranda Cosgrove"},{"name":"Dana Gaier Ellis","role":"Edith (voice)","photo":"/hw3Ou8cj22MLXl8QKrL8vcidcCB.jpg"},{"name":"السی فیشر","role":"Agnes (voice)","photo":"/lSmrN828nMMXHvwr7IgO1qlYPSa.jpg","en":"Elsie Fisher"},{"name":"Pierre Coffin","role":"Tim / Bob / Mark / Phil / Stuart (voice)","photo":"/eAA9uWRqHlm1LT3nZfXb7UuPfVb.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Renaud","role":"Dave (voice)","photo":"/sumBJgBqRkK4XEJ2JYXpad3MTJs.jpg"},{"name":"جامین کلمنت","role":"Jerry (voice)","photo":"/6eiNbeurpHb2fxIeT0RrJ0wRI25.jpg","en":"Jemaine Clement"}],"trailer":"zzCZ1W_CUoI","wat